            syllabus = listOf("Unsupervised Paradigms: Discovering Latent Topology Without Labels", "K-Means Clustering: Lloyd's Algorithm, Voronoi Partitions & Inertia", "Evaluation Metrics: Elbow Method & Silhouette Coefficient", "Hierarchical Clustering: Agglomerative Linkages (Single, Complete, Ward)", "Density-Based Clustering (DBSCAN) & Principal Component Analysis (PCA)"),
