                    options = mapOf("A" to "Grounding LLM responses on verifiable external knowledge to eliminate hallucinations and access private data", "B" to "Retraining the model's parametric weights from scratch every day", "C" to "Compressing images into text tokens", "D" to "Increasing model training batch size"),
